{%- comment -%}
  NF PARFUMS - PDP content block (marquee / moment / mission / how-to-use / FAQ)

  The product card is deliberately NOT here. It stays the theme's own
  `main-product` section, so the page looks and behaves exactly like every other
  product on the store.

  This block renders ONLY for products in the collections listed in
  nf_collections below. On every other product it outputs nothing at all - not
  even the font link - so one product template serves the whole catalogue.

  Install:
    1. Admin -> Online store -> Themes -> ... -> Edit code
    2. Snippets -> Add a new snippet -> name it  nf-parfums-pdp-content
    3. Paste this whole file, set nf_collections below, Save
    4. Theme editor -> Products -> product template -> Add section
       -> Custom Liquid -> paste:   {% render 'nf-parfums-pdp-content' %}
    5. Drag it below the product card ("main"), above Related products

  Handle confirmed from the store: shop.northfinder.com/collections/perfumes
  Add more, comma separated, if other markets use separate collections.

  English lives in the HTML. sk / de / hr / sl / bg are swapped at runtime from
  Shopify.locale by the script at the end - no Translate & Adapt needed.

  Nothing is hidden behind JavaScript: if the script never runs, every section is
  still painted and readable.

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  CHANGELOG
  2026-08-18  Added the theme's "Description and parameters" section to the
              hidden-sections rule (see HIDE THEME SECTIONS below). Its content
              renders broken on perfumes - empty bullets, unstyled headings.
              Font request trimmed from 400;500;600;700 to 500;700: the CSS in
              this file only ever uses 500 and 700, and the brand manual permits
              only Montserrat Medium and Bold. Two fewer font files to download.
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- comment -%} ---- WHERE THIS SHOWS - edit these two lines only ---- {%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign nf_collections = 'perfumes' -%}
{%- assign nf_tag = 'nf-parfums' -%}

{%- assign nf_show = false -%}
{%- if product != blank -%}
  {%- assign nf_wanted = nf_collections | split: ',' -%}
  {%- for nf_c in product.collections -%}
    {%- for nf_w in nf_wanted -%}
      {%- assign nf_h = nf_w | strip -%}
      {%- if nf_h != blank and nf_c.handle == nf_h -%}{%- assign nf_show = true -%}{%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
  {%- if nf_tag != blank and product.tags contains nf_tag -%}
    {%- assign nf_show = true -%}
  {%- endif -%}
{%- endif -%}

{%- if nf_show -%}
