    <div class="nfp-fq">
      <details open><summary class="nfp-q1">How do I use the laundry perfume?</summary><div class="nfp-fqp nfp-w1">Add the laundry perfume straight into the fabric-softener compartment of your washing machine. The recommended dose is <strong>5 ml per 4&ndash;5 kg load</strong>. It works with any detergent, but do not combine it with fabric softener &mdash; that would dilute the fragrance.</div></details>
